            "controller_support": "full",
            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/384700/extras/849133c57031f84b81d95ac68c39ca54.avif?t=1789103399\" width=600 height=107 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Umihara Kawase Shun is now available on Steam as the Steam Edition!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Originally released for the PlayStation in 1997, Umihara Kawase Shun is a puzzle platformer and the second entry in the &quot;Rubbering Action&quot; series, challenging players to reach the goal by mastering a highly elastic rubber rope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its unique action mechanics, deep gameplay, and charming visuals brought to life through hand-drawn animated illustrations, this acclaimed action game has inspired a passionate fanbase over the years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fields from Umihara Kawase Shun, Umihara Kawase Shun: Second Edition, and Second Edition Complete Version have been restructured and brought together as the Steam Edition!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/384700/extras/f534180f4cccca60f2148ac2bd0bf4a0.avif?t=1789103399\" width=600 height=332 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Steam Edition Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fields carefully selected from Shun, Second Edition, and Complete Version, with routes restructured</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inherits the UI and features from Sayonara Umihara Kawase, making the game more user-friendly and enjoyable to play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Cloud support and Global Leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exchange replay data with other players through Steam Workshop</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Credits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Design &amp; Lead Programmer:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kiyoshi Sakai</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Design:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toshinobu Kondo</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/384700/extras/75ae2c0bcfe56cb8d963e75a787e2ac3.avif?t=1789103399\" width=600 height=332 /></span></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/384700/extras/849133c57031f84b81d95ac68c39ca54.avif?t=1789103399\" width=600 height=107 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Umihara Kawase Shun is now available on Steam as the Steam Edition!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Originally released for the PlayStation in 1997, Umihara Kawase Shun is a puzzle platformer and the second entry in the &quot;Rubbering Action&quot; series, challenging players to reach the goal by mastering a highly elastic rubber rope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its unique action mechanics, deep gameplay, and charming visuals brought to life through hand-drawn animated illustrations, this acclaimed action game has inspired a passionate fanbase over the years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fields from Umihara Kawase Shun, Umihara Kawase Shun: Second Edition, and Second Edition Complete Version have been restructured and brought together as the Steam Edition!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/384700/extras/f534180f4cccca60f2148ac2bd0bf4a0.avif?t=1789103399\" width=600 height=332 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Steam Edition Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fields carefully selected from Shun, Second Edition, and Complete Version, with routes restructured</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inherits the UI and features from Sayonara Umihara Kawase, making the game more user-friendly and enjoyable to play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Cloud support and Global Leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exchange replay data with other players through Steam Workshop</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Credits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Design &amp; Lead Programmer:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kiyoshi Sakai</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Design:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toshinobu Kondo</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/384700/extras/75ae2c0bcfe56cb8d963e75a787e2ac3.avif?t=1789103399\" width=600 height=332 /></span></p>",
            "short_description": "The classic action game Umihara Kawase Shun, beloved by fans since 1997, comes to Steam! Conquer fields from Shun, Second Edition, and Complete Edition using a stretchy rubber rope. Includes Steam Cloud, Global Leaderboards, and Steam Workshop!",
